 "title": "加载操作接口",
 "content": "<p label=\"一级标题\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 42px; margin: 0px;\">1 接口介绍</p><p>加载操作服务是指通过在url参数中指定某个具体的业务对象主键，调用服务按结构化返回该业务对象所有数据。</p><p><br/></p><p label=\"一级标题\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 42px; margin: 0px;\">2 注意事项</p><p>加载服务仅支持加载单条数据，请求参数必须为主键”id”或”number”，接口会根据主键加载出该业务对象的所有明细信息。<strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">当单据或基础资料中存在附件时，也可以通过加载接口得到该插件的相关信息，如url存放地址等。</strong></p><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"\"><br/></strong></span></div><p><br/></p><p label=\"一级标题\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 42px; margin: 0px;\">3 接口示例</p><p label=\"二级标题\" style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px 0px; line-height: 42px; margin: 0px;\">3.1 币别加载</p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"655\" style=\"\"><p><strong>URL：</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">{{host}}/</span>kapi/sys/bd_currency/load?number=CNY<br/></p><p><strong><br/></strong></p><p><strong>请求方式：</strong>GET</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>请求Header参数：</strong></p><p>Content-Type=application/json</p><p>accessToken: xxxxxxxxxxxxx</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" width=\"655\"><p><strong>请求结果：</strong></p><p>{</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;data&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;id&quot;: 1,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;number&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_TW&quot;: &quot;人民幣&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;en_US&quot;: &quot;Yuan Renminbi&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;GLang&quot;: &quot;人民币&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;人民币&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;status&quot;: &quot;C&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;creator&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;id&quot;: 1,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;number&quot;: &quot;administrator&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;GLang&quot;: &quot;administrator&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;administrator&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;masterid&quot;: 1</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;modifier&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;id&quot;: 1164285916651471872,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;number&quot;: &quot;0003&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;name&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_TW&quot;: &quot;李江超&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;GLang&quot;: &quot;李江超&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;李江超&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;masterid&quot;: 1164285916651471872</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;enable&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;createtime&quot;: &quot;2021-07-26 18:08:11&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;modifytime&quot;: &quot;2021-08-29 18:21:59&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;masterid&quot;: 1,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;disabler&quot;: null,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;disabledate&quot;: null,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;amtprecision&quot;: 4,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;priceprecision&quot;: 6,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;isshowsign&quot;: true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;format&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;sign&quot;: &quot;¥&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;description&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_TW&quot;: &quot;&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;en_US&quot;: &quot;&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;logo&quot;: &quot;&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;issystem&quot;: true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;sortcode&quot;: &quot;851&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;_attachments&quot;: []</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;},</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;success&quot;: true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;errorCode&quot;: &quot;success&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;message&quot;: null</p><p>}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">3.2 demo加载（含附件）</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\"><br/></span></p><table><tbody style=\"\"><tr class=\"firstRow\" style=\"\"><td width=\"655\" style=\"\"><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\">URL：</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">{{host}}/</span>kapi/sys/<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">isc_demo_basedata_1/load?number=fujiantest</span></p><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\"><br/></strong></p><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\">请求方式：</strong>GET</p><p style=\"\"><br/></p><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\">请求Header参数：</strong></p><p style=\"\">Content-Type=application/json</p><p style=\"\">accessToken: xxxxxxxxxxxxx</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"\"><br/></p><table><tbody style=\"\"><tr class=\"firstRow\" style=\"\"><td width=\"655\" style=\"\"><p style=\"\"><strong style=\"\">请求结果：</strong></p><p style=\"\"><br/></p><p>{</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;data&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;id&quot;: 1360936366220784640,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;number&quot;: &quot;fujiantest&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;name&quot;: &quot;fujiantest&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;creator&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;id&quot;: 1062210004364308480,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;number&quot;: &quot;52360&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;name&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;GLang&quot;: &quot;张三&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;<span style=\"\">张三</span>&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;masterid&quot;: 1062210004364308480</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;createtime&quot;: &quot;2022-02-21 17:37:08&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;modifier&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;id&quot;: 1062210004364308480,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;number&quot;: &quot;52360&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;name&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;GLang&quot;: &quot;<span style=\"\">张三</span>&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;<span style=\"\">张三</span>&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;masterid&quot;: 1062210004364308480</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;modifytime&quot;: &quot;2022-02-21 17:38:41&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;alias_name&quot;: {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;zh_TW&quot;: &quot;test&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;zh_CN&quot;: &quot;test&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;entryentity&quot;: [],</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;itemclasstype&quot;: &quot;&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;itemclass&quot;: null,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;attachmentfield&quot;: [],</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;_attachments&quot;: [</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;panel&quot;: &quot;attachmentpanelap&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://feature.kingdee.com:1026/patchopen/attachment/download.do?path=/43b5e3fd617349719d80068fa7d3b4f2&amp;kdedcba=MTE3MzkxMDUzNjA2MDkyODAwMF9EeUk4YjJKTG85dGs5SGxUSXVqZHNaWkRKbnJLeEY5OVRmVTYwbVlzYXVhSFFhU0xCVUMwbkYxOUNPdjQzMVQzTUVrbWJVcEFCTDdBOHMyQXM1dXVYWGQ3aldXV0tVSmFLMTRnfn4xNjQ1NDM2MzI2NTQ2&quot;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ]</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;success&quot;: true,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;errorCode&quot;: &quot;success&quot;,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;message&quot;: null</p><p>}</p><p style=\"\"><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"\"><br/></p><p label=\"一级标题\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 42px; margin: 0px;\">4 返回参数说明</p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\"><p><strong>序号</strong></p></td><td style=\"\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></td><td style=\"\"><p><strong>解释</strong></p></td><td style=\"\"><p><strong>返回值实例</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\"><p>1</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>success</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>是否成功</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>true/false</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\"><p>2</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>errorCode</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>错误编码</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>success/false</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\"><p>3</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>message</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>提示信息</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>null</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\"><p>4</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>data</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>业务对象数据</p></td><td style=\"\"><p>{ &quot;id&quot;: 1,&quot;number&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: {&quot;zh_TW&quot;: &quot;人民幣&quot;,...}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p>",
